---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Resource Builder | Skill Foundry" description="Private publishing workspace for preparing Skill Foundry resources." robots="noindex, nofollow, noarchive">
  <section class="builder-page">
    <div class="builder-shell">
      <div class="builder-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">RESOURCE BUILDER</p>
        <h1>Create a resource without writing code.</h1>
        <p>Prepare a resource in the same order visitors will read it. Save a browser draft, preview it, and download a publish-ready Markdown file.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="notice"><strong>Manual publishing fallback</strong><span>Use finished image URLs or site paths. This builder does not generate AI images or upload files by itself. Later, a GitHub publishing connection can handle the final upload automatically.</span></div>

      <form id="resource-form" class="builder-grid">
        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>01</span><h2>Core details</h2></div><div class="field-grid">
          <label>Title<input name="title" required placeholder="Premium AI Product Photography Prompt" /></label>
          <label>Slug<div class="input-action"><input name="slug" placeholder="premium-ai-product-photography-prompt" /><button class="mini-button" id="make-slug" type="button">Generate</button></div></label>
          <label>Category<select name="category" required><option value="" selected disabled>Select a category</option><option>Image Generation</option><option>Video Generation</option><option>Product Photography</option><option>AI Tools</option><option>AI Workflows</option><option>Automation</option><option>Prompts</option><option>Tutorials</option><option>Other</option></select></label>
          <label>Tool / Model<input name="tool" required placeholder="e.g. Midjourney, Runway, ChatGPT" /></label>
          <label class="full">Short description<textarea name="description" required rows="3" placeholder="A concise description used on resource cards and metadata."></textarea></label>
          <label>Date<input name="date" type="date" required /></label>
          <label>Image alt text<input name="imageAlt" placeholder="Describe the main result image" /></label>
        </div></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>02</span><h2>Hero & thumbnail</h2></div><p class="panel-help">Paste a direct image URL or a site path such as <code>/images/my-resource.jpg</code>. The hero image appears at the top of the resource page; the thumbnail is used in cards and related resources.</p><div class="field-grid">
          <label>Thumbnail image URL / path<input name="thumbnail" placeholder="https://.../image.jpg or /images/my-resource.jpg" /></label>
          <label>Hero image URL / path<input name="heroImage" placeholder="https://.../image.jpg or /images/my-resource.jpg" /></label>
        </div></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>03</span><h2>Introduction</h2></div><label class="full">Introduction<textarea name="intro" rows="6" placeholder="Explain what the resource is, what it is for, and when to use it."></textarea></label></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>04</span><h2>What this resource does</h2></div><label class="full">Explanation<textarea name="whatItDoes" rows="6" placeholder="Explain the practical result and important details visible in the output."></textarea></label></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>05</span><h2>Tools used</h2></div><p class="panel-help">Add every tool used or recommended. Each tool gets its own name, purpose, website link, and optional affiliate status.</p><div id="tools-list" class="repeat-list"></div><button class="add-button" data-add="tool" type="button">+ Add tool</button></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>06</span><h2>Results</h2></div><p class="panel-help">Add the starting image when there is one, then add every important output image. These are shown together in the resource's Results section.</p><div class="result-input"><label>Input / starting image URL or path<input name="inputImage" placeholder="https://.../input.jpg or /images/input.jpg" /></label></div><div class="subsection"><div class="subheading"><p class="panel-help">Output images</p><button class="add-button" data-add="result" type="button">+ Add output image</button></div><div id="results-list" class="repeat-list"></div></div></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>07</span><h2>Prompt</h2></div><label class="full">Complete prompt<textarea name="prompt" required rows="16" placeholder="Paste the complete prompt exactly as users should copy it."></textarea></label></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>08</span><h2>Tutorial</h2></div><div class="field-grid">
          <label>Tutorial embed URL<input name="videoEmbedUrl" placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/embed/..." /></label>
          <label>Original tutorial URL<input name="originalVideoUrl" placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=..." /></label>
        </div><p class="panel-help bottom-help">Leave both fields empty when the resource has no tutorial.</p></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>09</span><h2>Step by step</h2></div><div class="subheading"><p class="panel-help">Add the actual actions a visitor should follow. Each step has a title and description.</p><button class="add-button" data-add="step" type="button">+ Add step</button></div><div id="steps-list" class="repeat-list"></div></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>10</span><h2>Tips for better results</h2></div><div class="subheading"><p class="panel-help">Add useful customization or troubleshooting tips.</p><button class="add-button" data-add="tip" type="button">+ Add tip</button></div><div id="tips-list" class="repeat-list"></div></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>11</span><h2>Tags</h2></div><p class="panel-help">Use focused search terms. Add as many tags as needed.</p><div id="tags-list" class="repeat-list"></div><button class="add-button" data-add="tag" type="button">+ Add tag</button></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>12</span><h2>Related resources</h2></div><p class="panel-help">Add the slugs of resources that should appear in the Related resources section.</p><div id="related-list" class="repeat-list"></div><button class="add-button" data-add="related" type="button">+ Add related</button></section>

        <section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span>13</span><h2>SEO & publishing</h2></div><div class="field-grid">
          <label class="full">SEO title<input name="seoTitle" placeholder="Unique search title for this resource" /></label>
          <label class="full">SEO description<textarea name="seoDescription" rows="3" placeholder="Unique search description for this resource."></textarea></label>
          <label class="check"><input name="featured" type="checkbox" /> Feature this resource on the homepage</label>
        </div><div class="actions"><button class="button button-secondary" id="save-draft" type="button">Save draft</button><button class="button button-secondary" id="clear-draft" type="button">Clear draft</button><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Download resource file</button></div><p class="status" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
      </form>

      <section class="preview panel" aria-live="polite"><div class="panel-heading"><span>14</span><h2>Live preview</h2></div><div id="preview-content" class="preview-content"><p>Start filling the form to preview your resource.</p></div></section>
    </div>
  </section>
  <style>
    .builder-page{padding:58px 0 90px}.builder-shell{width:min(1080px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:0 auto}.builder-heading{max-width:800px;margin-bottom:28px}.builder-heading h1{margin-top:0;font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,62px)}.builder-heading p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:760px;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px}.notice{display:grid;gap:5px;margin-bottom:20px;padding:15px 17px;border:1px solid rgba(61,214,208,.2);border-radius:14px;background:rgba(61,214,208,.055);color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.notice strong{color:var(--text)}.builder-grid{display:grid;gap:18px}.panel{padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025)}.panel-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-bottom:20px}.panel-heading span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:30px;height:30px;flex:0 0 auto;border:1px solid rgba(61,214,208,.3);border-radius:9px;color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.panel-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:20px}.panel-help{margin:-7px 0 18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.bottom-help{margin:15px 0 0}.field-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}label{display:grid;gap:7px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700}label.full{grid-column:1/-1}input,textarea,select{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:rgba(7,17,31,.75);color:var(--text);font:inherit;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;outline:none}input,select{min-height:46px;padding:10px 12px}textarea{padding:11px 12px;resize:vertical}select{appearance:auto}input:focus,textarea:focus,select:focus{border-color:rgba(61,214,208,.55);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(61,214,208,.07)}.input-action{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:7px}.mini-button,.add-button,.remove-button{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);color:var(--muted);font:inherit;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.mini-button{padding:0 11px}.mini-button:hover,.add-button:hover,.remove-button:hover{border-color:rgba(61,214,208,.45);color:var(--accent)}.repeat-list{display:grid;gap:10px}.repeat-item{display:grid;gap:9px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(7,17,31,.45)}.repeat-item.two{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:start}.repeat-item.tool{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr) auto}.repeat-item.step{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.7fr) minmax(0,1.3fr) auto}.repeat-item label{font-size:11px}.repeat-item input,.repeat-item textarea{min-height:42px;font-size:13px}.remove-button{min-height:42px;padding:0 11px}.check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--muted)}.check input{width:17px;height:17px;min-height:0;accent-color:var(--accent)}.subsection{margin-top:22px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.subheading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:11px}.subheading .panel-help{margin:0}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:22px}.status{min-height:20px;margin:10px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.preview{margin-top:18px}.preview-content{display:grid;gap:15px}.preview-content h3{margin:0;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,42px);line-height:1.1}.preview-content h4{margin:8px 0 -7px;font-size:15px}.preview-meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.preview-copy{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;white-space:pre-wrap}.preview-image{width:min(100%,720px);max-height:420px;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px}.preview-list{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:0;padding-left:20px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.preview-prompt{padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;background:rgba(7,17,31,.7);color:var(--muted);white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.preview-tools{display:grid;gap:9px}.preview-tool{padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px}.preview-tool strong{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--text)}.preview-tool span{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.result-input{max-width:720px}
    @media(max-width:700px){.builder-shell{width:min(calc(100% - 28px),1080px)}.builder-page{padding-top:38px}.field-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}label.full{grid-column:auto}.panel{padding:17px;border-radius:15px}.actions .button{width:100%}.repeat-item.tool,.repeat-item.step,.repeat-item.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.remove-button{width:100%}.input-action{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mini-button{min-height:42px}.subheading{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.subheading .add-button{width:100%}}
  </style>
  <script src="/admin/resource-builder.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
